# ReactDemos Repository Context

This repository is a monorepo comparing React 16 and React 19 patterns side by side, hosted on Vercel, built with Turborepo + pnpm + Vite + Tailwind CSS 4.

## Apps

- `apps/react-v19` on port `5173`
- `apps/react-v16` on port `5174`

## Hosting

- `react19.nxhhuy.tech` and `react16.nxhhuy.tech` on Vercel
- DNS managed via Cloudflare/Namecheap

## CI/CD

- GitHub Actions -> Vercel CLI deploy on push to `development`
- Telegram notifications

## Workflow Rules (Always Follow)

1. Stop and ask before every next step; never proceed autonomously.
2. After every session:
   - Append a dated entry to `.agents/SESSION-LOG.md` (what was done, what's next, any blockers).
   - Update `CHANGELOG.md` under `## [Unreleased]`.
3. When working on React components or performance, consult `.agents/skills/vercel-react-best-practices/`.
4. When working on component architecture or React 19 APIs, consult `.agents/skills/vercel-composition-patterns/`.
5. When working on animations or view transitions, consult `.agents/skills/vercel-react-view-transitions/`.
6. When deploying to Vercel via CLI or tokens, consult `.agents/skills/vercel-cli-with-tokens/`.
7. Always prefer explicit over implicit: no magic, no assumptions.
